00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:55.125
and some other things,
Platform as a Service,

00:18:55.125 --> 00:18:57.397
some other things
more like Kubernetes.

00:18:57.397 --> 00:18:59.480
But the good thing is that
you can use all of them

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:00.040
at the same time.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:00.430
MARK MANDEL: Exactly.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.320
FRANCESC CAMPOY: There's nothing
