00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.558
You can just pick and choose.

00:19:04.558 --> 00:19:05.766
MARK MANDEL: Pick and choose.

00:19:05.766 --> 00:19:06.460
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.340
MARK MANDEL: Lovely.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:07.400
All right.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.530
I think that sounds
